WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.166
Roxy landed in Metro City Park.

2
00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:08.305
"It's Rocket Girl!" cried Mara.

3
00:00:08.306 --> 00:00:10.076
Roxy looked around.

4
00:00:10.077 --> 00:00:13.586
Monster dogs and cats were everywhere!

5
00:00:13.587 --> 00:00:16.538
Several monster pets were on the tennis court.

6
00:00:16.539 --> 00:00:19.465
The court was surrounded by a tall fence.

7
00:00:19.466 --> 00:00:22.914
A monster cat hissed at a man selling balloons.

8
00:00:22.915 --> 00:00:25.632
The cat jumped up and stuck out its claws.

9
00:00:25.633 --> 00:00:27.709
Pop! Pop! Pop!

10
00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.186
The cat popped all the balloons.

11
00:00:30.187 --> 00:00:36.948
"My balloons are ruined!" cried the balloon man.

12
00:00:36.949 --> 00:00:41.643
Roxy noticed the cat's collar. It was glowing.

13
00:00:41.644 --> 00:00:43.941
"MEOW!"

14
00:00:43.942 --> 00:00:45.736
Roxy spun around.

15
00:00:45.737 --> 00:00:48.405
Another monster cat was creeping toward her!

16
00:00:48.406 --> 00:00:54.857
Roxy gasped. "It has a glowing collar too!"

17
00:00:54.858 --> 00:00:59.208
Phwoof! The cat shot a flaming hairball toward Roxy.

18
00:00:59.209 --> 00:01:02.346
Roxy made a fist and—

19
00:01:02.347 --> 00:01:04.690
bam! She knocked the hairball

20
00:01:04.691 --> 00:01:07.670
away. "Help, Rocket Girl!" cried

21
00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:10.372
Terrell. Roxy glanced back at her

22
00:01:10.373 --> 00:01:14.929
friends. Two monster dogs were growling and moving toward

23
00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:16.977
them! Roxy whistled

24
00:01:16.978 --> 00:01:19.940
loudly. The dogs turned and charged toward

25
00:01:19.941 --> 00:01:23.946
Roxy. She ran to the tennis court and stood in front of the open

26
00:01:23.947 --> 00:01:28.440
gate. "GRR!" The dogs growled and raced toward

27
00:01:28.441 --> 00:01:31.154
Roxy. Just before they reached her, she jumped

28
00:01:31.155 --> 00:01:35.684
up. The dogs tumbled onto the tennis

29
00:01:35.685 --> 00:01:38.831
court. "Ha!" cried Roxy as she slammed shut the

30
00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:42.562
gate. Terrell, Mara, and Jack cheered.

31
00:01:42.563 --> 00:01:46.374
"Yay, Rocket Girl!" cried Mara.

32
00:01:46.375 --> 00:01:50.333
Roxy zoomed into the air.

33
00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:55.515
"Those glowing collars must be turning pets into monsters," she thought.

34
00:01:55.516 --> 00:02:00.390
"Ralphie's owner said she got the glowing collar from Mr. Snippy.

35
00:02:00.391 --> 00:02:03.666
But where is Mr. Snippy's Pet Salon?"

36
00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:07.056
Just then a man yelled, "Bad dog, Buster!"

37
00:02:07.057 --> 00:02:09.545
Roxy looked down.

38
00:02:09.546 --> 00:02:11.766
The man was missing a shoe.

39
00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:14.661
He was wagging a finger at a monster dog.

40
00:02:14.662 --> 00:02:18.272
The dog was chewing on something as his collar glowed.

41
00:02:18.273 --> 00:02:20.595
Roxy flew down to the man.

42
00:02:20.596 --> 00:02:24.109
"Excuse me. Is this your dog?"

43
00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.067
"Yes," said the man.

44
00:02:26.068 --> 00:02:30.729
"And he's very bad! He just ate my shoe!"

45
00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:35.269
"Did you get that collar from Mr. Snippy's Pet Salon?"

46
00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:37.723
"Yes." The man looked surprised.

47
00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:39.559
"How did you know?"

48
00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:41.846
"Never mind," said Roxy.

49
00:02:41.847 --> 00:02:44.277
"Just tell me where the salon is."

50
00:02:44.278 --> 00:02:47.799
The man told Roxy the salon's address.

51
00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.409
Roxy zipped through the air again.

52
00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:54.692
A moment later she threw open the salon's doors.

53
00:02:54.693 --> 00:02:57.772
A thin man with a bow tie spun around.

54
00:02:57.773 --> 00:03:00.656
He wore gloves with sharp blades.

55
00:03:00.663 --> 00:03:05.067
When he saw Roxy, his lips curled into a nasty smile.

56
00:03:05.068 --> 00:03:08.538
"Welcome to Mr. Snippy's, Rocket Girl!"

57
00:03:08.539 --> 00:03:11.112
His sharp blades clacked loudly.

58
00:03:11.113 --> 00:03:16.908
"I suppose you're here for a cut!"

